# This file is not one of the five directories packer_sync.py syncs, so upstream's rules are repeated here. Without the
# two table rules below every packing run left dm/games/<id>/*.tsv in the tree and 77 build outputs ended up committed.
.iosdd/
.iosdd_mac/
.iosdd_*/
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
dm/ios/Gen/

# Made from each shader build's Mac outputs (c1_guard.py, cb_extent.py; the NSP script makes them), not committed
dm/games/*/c1_full.tsv
dm/games/*/cb_extent.tsv
# Same for the per-profile chain version header: nxn_pack.py runs dmsh_chain.py --header and copies it in beside the
# game_profile.h that make generates. The shell's placeholder profile is the exception, because a shell serves any game:
# its header says DMSH_CHAIN "000000000000" and the run-time version is read from the library directory instead.
dm/games/*/dmsh_chain.h
!dm/games/0000000000000000/dmsh_chain.h

# dm/gfx/tools/dmsh_chain.lock stays tracked (upstream tracks it too): it is the toolchain the chain version was computed
# with. A packing run rewrites it whenever this machine's tools differ, and that rewrite is this machine's fingerprint,
# not a source change -- leave it out of a commit unless the change is deliberate.

# This repository is public. Game files and keys must never be committed, whatever a packing run leaves behind
# in the tree. The shell carries no game content by design, so none of these are ever needed here.
*.nsp
*.xci
*.nsz
*.xcz
*.nca
*.ncz
*.tik
*.keys
prod.keys
console.keys
*.ipa
*.xip
data/
out/
built/
work/

# Upstream's own CI. Two of its four jobs compile the Mac packing and checking chain this fork leaves out on purpose
# (dm/ios/tools/compile_check.py, build_smoke.py, dm/ios/tests), so it would fail here for reasons that say nothing about
# the shell. The shell has its own workflow: shell.yml. dm/ios and docs now match upstream 4639c51 otherwise.
.github/workflows/tests.yml

# What the packer keeps beside itself: the several-game library and the shader cache (both live in the exe's folder, or in
# the folder the packer was run from). Neither is source, and a run from inside this checkout must not leave either here.
ns2ios-library/
ns2ios-shader-cache/
